# SiteDoc AI environment variables.
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. Every variable here is OPTIONAL: the app
# runs fully without them and falls back to a deterministic remediation report.
#
# The AI remediation layer uses whichever provider key is present. If both are
# set, Anthropic (Claude) takes precedence.

# --- Anthropic (Claude) ---
# When set, completed audits are enriched with a Claude-generated report.
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional model override. Defaults to claude-opus-4-8.
# SITEDOC_AI_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8

# --- OpenAI (used when no Anthropic key is set) ---
# Get a key at https://platform.openai.com/
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Optional model override. Defaults to gpt-4o-mini (supports Structured Outputs).
# SITEDOC_OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
